OL,3,GNEWSASnooker champ rediscovers love for
OL,4,Agame at 74
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former disability snooker champion
OL,7,Fhas been able to rediscover his love
OL,8,Ffor the game at the age of 74 with help
OL,9,Ffrom his care home and a community
OL,10,Fgroup.
OL,12,FWhen Steven Smith, from Rotherham,
OL,13,Fmentioned to staff at Moorgate Lodge
OL,14,Fthat he would love to watch snooker
OL,15,Fagain, they approached nearby
OL,16,FSnooker4All Academy to see if they
OL,17,Fcould help him play at their tables.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
