OL,3,GNEWSASnooker champ rediscovers love for
OL,4,Agame at 74
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite having to adapt his grip
OL,7,Fbecause of rheumatoid arthritis in his
OL,8,Fhands, Smith, who thought he would
OL,9,F"never play again", now visits the
OL,10,Fsnooker hall twice monthly and even
OL,11,Fbrings other residents along for a
OL,12,Fframe.
OL,14,FSmith admitted it "was a bit hard"
OL,15,Finitially but he was "very happy" to be
OL,16,Fback at the baize.
